<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest tracks your progress for the Tier 2 difficulty of the Abyss of Mordath. It allows you and your fellows to resume adventuring in the Abyss of Mordath at the furthest checkpoint you have reached in each weekly cycle. This quest will automatically reset on every Thursday.</rgb>","The Order of the Eye has crossed the Abyss dividing the Black Pits into a towering structure built into the foundations of Barad-dûr.","Defeat Sagróg, the Bitter Warden, and enter the Ring-prisons in pursuit of the Firehorns"},
[11655]={"El aldeano condenado se encuentra en la aldea maldita de Audaghaim, en los Troncosombríos, al este de la Posada Embrujada.\
\
Deberías enfrentarte de nuevo a él, esta vez con pleno conocimiento de la verdad que trató de ocultar.","'Ahora conocemos la verdad, pero no debe quedar ahí. No se debe permitir que los asesinos sigan existiendo bajo su maldición de este modo, con su culpa sofocada y apaciguada por la negación y las mentiras.\
\
'Debes enfrentarte de nuevo al espectro, pero esta vez armado con la verdad. Me gustaría ver si admite sus fechorías como un hombre honorable, pero de algún modo lo dudo.\
\
'El misterio está resuelto, pero ¿de qué sirve si se permite que los asesinos perduren? Harás mucho por la memoria de aquellos Hombres dignos que perecieron en este terrible tiempo en Audaghaim.'","Enfréntate de nuevo al aldeano condenado","Habla con Prestadír en la Posada Embrujada","Prestadír ahora comprende que el aldeano condenado con el que hablaste anteriormente orquestó los asesinatos de todos aquellos que se resistieron al \\qprogreso\\q de la influencia del Nigromante. Desea que la negación del espectro se enfrente por fin a la verdad enterrada durante tanto tiempo.","'Estamos cerca de vengar a los valientes Hombres que cayeron enfrentándose al mal que se apoderó de este lugar. Deberías volver a enfrentarte al espectro condenado con el que hablaste al principio.'","'¡No! ¡Es imposible! Esa... esa historia ya no es cierta. Destruimos ese pasado y seguimos adelante con nuestras vidas. ¿Por qué perturbas nuestra larga paz con males que deberían permanecer enterrados? ¡No se puede permitir que esa historia perdure! ¡Pagarás caro tu intromisión, forastero!'","La aldea maldita","'¡Bienvenido de nuevo, ${PLAYER}! Has hecho una muy, muy buena acción en nombre de aquellos que cayeron resistiendo las malignas influencias del Señor Oscuro. Es una historia trágica, pero ha sido lo mejor no permitir que su negación perdurara.\
\
'Deberías sentirte orgulloso de lo que has logrado hoy, aunque ya sea demasiado tarde para ayudar a los pobres leñadores que murieron hace tantos años. Su historia no debe quedar enterrada bajo las corrupciones del Bosque Negro, pues fueron héroes, y la verdad merece ser convertida en canción y recordada, no olvidada como desearían los asesinos.\
\
'La culpa y la negación son los enemigos más crueles. Has hecho bien en combatirlos con tal determinación.'","Prestadír te espera en la Posada Embrujada en los Troncosombríos, al oeste de Audaghaim.\
\
Deberías hablar con él y decirle que el oscuro pasado de Audaghaim ha sido finalmente enfrentado."},
[11656]={"Extinguished fires in the western fields of the Broadacres (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The loss of Tordag grieves me, for he was a good friend and a stout warrior. However, I must look to the defence of my Riding...there will be time for sorrow later.\
\
'Warg-riders roam to and fro among the fields to the west, burning everything they see. Will you ride out and extinguish as many of the fires that you can? I would have something left of the Acres to pass down to my son.\
\
'Be alert for an ambush...the goblins are vicious creatures who would just as soon put you to the torch.'","Equip bucket and extinguish fires in the western fields of the Broadacres (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","After failing the assault on Torsbury, Torferth sent you back to Stoke to inform Reeve Fríthild that he and his people would be late in coming.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: The bucket skill may only be used while on a war-steed.</rgb>","Fires can be found throughout the fields west of Stoke in the Broadacres.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to ride out and extinguish the fires that the Warg-riders started in the Broadacres.","The Acres Aflame"},
[11657]={"Hasna is too nervous to give Phêrida Iron-edge the vine circlet and has asked you to go instead.\
\
Phêrida can be found at the Dahâl Huliz.","<rgb=#FF0000>You've been spotted!</rgb>","A woman waits outside the Dahâl Huliz to see her favourite Hûlaz.","Before you can utter a single word, the Hûlaz politely holds up a hand to stop you.\
\
'This is from Hasna, is it not? I noticed she stopped coming to watch my fights, but she has always been there for me after. Even if she has been too nervous to approach me.' She chuckles. 'It was very sweet of you to help. Now, I do believe it is time for me to talk to her, so if you will excuse me....'","Hasna has asked you to pick leafy vines from trellises. However, you must avoid being spotted by gardeners more than a few times.\
\
The trellises can be found around the eastern side of the Tor-gardens pool.","Talk to Hasna at the Dahâl Huliz","The Adoring Fan","'Phêrida is just over there! Quick, give me the vines and I shall weave as fast as I can!'\
\
The instant you hand her the vines, Hasna's nimble fingers go to work. Within a short amount of time, she holds out an impressive circlet made of vines.\
\
'I -- I cannot give this to her. My nerves are getting the best of me. Please go in my stead.'","Habla con Phêrida Filohierro","'Are you here to see the Hûliz too? I never have time to watch the fights nowadays, so I come to at least catch a glimpse of them. My favourite is Phêrida Iron-edge -- I used to go to every one of her matches! The way she fights -- '\
\
She stops, red colouring her cheeks.\
\
'Sorry. I did not mean to ramble.\
\
'I had hoped to weave a vine circlet for Phêrida, but the gardeners have seen me take from the trellises one too many times. You, though... you are a fresh face! If you are willing to aid me, the trellises on the eastern side of the pool always have the best vines.'","You have gathered many leafy vines.\
\
You should bring them back to Hasna at the Dahâl Huliz.","Picked leafy vines (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Pick leafy vines from trellises (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","<rgb=#FF0000>You must not be spotted by sharp-eyed gardeners! (${NUMBER}/4)</rgb>"},
[11658]={"'Gracias por venir a verme hasta aquí,. Sé que te he pedido mucho, ¡pero eras tú quien podía ayudarme! Te lo agradezco muchísimo.\
\
'Imagino que te estarás preguntando qué hace alguien como yo tan lejos de casa. Tengo el honor de ser aprendiz de la maestra cocinera Lyn Madecedera. Ella me envió al Bosque Salvaje a recolectar ingredientes para la primera Fiesta del Bosque Salvaje de la historia.\
\
'Pero, ¡ay! Ya sabes cómo acabó todo. Te agradezco mucho toda la ayuda que me has prestado y me da pena pedirte más... ¡pero te la voy a pedir! ¡Necesito desesperadamente tu ayuda para recolectar ingredientes, o el banquete se echará a perder! ¡Yo me echaré a perder!'","'¡Esas huellas son sin duda de las enormes patas de Pisador! ¿Pero unas huellas tan gigantes? ¡Ay, ay, ay! ¡Me temo que el pobre Pisador está a punto de convertirse en comida para los huargos! Por favor, ${PLAYER}, ¡tenemos que encontrarlo!'","Sigue el rastro de Pisador","Pisador ha huido al Bosque Salvaje occidental.\
\
Deberías buscar señales de la huida de Pisador.","Busca a Pisador","¡Has encontrado huellas!","Cazadores de ponis derrotados en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Estas huellas parecen recientes! ¡Está cerca!","Las aventuras de Pisador","'¡Pobre Pisador! ¡Debe de estar tan asustado! ¡Por favor, encuéntralo!'","Minda se encuentra en la parte central del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Minda Matosos.","Habla con Minda Matosos","Derrota a los cazadores de ponis del Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Minda se encuentra en la parte occidental del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías hablar con Minda Matosos.","Tras escapar del malvado ladrón de carromatos, Pisador el poni ha huido, ¡pero puede que se esté metiendo en un peligro aún mayor!","¡Pisador fue por aquí!","'¡Pisador! ¡Lo has conseguido, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'¡Ay, pero mi carro! ¡Mi precioso carro! ¡Está completamente destrozado! Bueno, supongo que debo dar gracias por lo que me queda. ¡Gracias, ${PLAYER}! Vamos, salgamos de aquí, no sea que vengan más bandidos o huargos en busca de sus amigos. He oído que hay un estanque cerca, y parece que a Pisador le vendría bien beber un poco. ¡Nos vemos allí!'","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar huellas de cascos.\
\
Deberías buscar más huellas de Pisador, el poni.","'¡Qué alegría! Has encontrado mis provisiones. Ay, pero ¿dónde estará el pobre Pisador? ¿Ves algún rastro de él? ¡Ay, ay, ay!'","En el Bosque Salvaje se pueden encontrar cazadores de ponis.\
\
Minda Matosos te ha pedido que derrotes a los huargos que están cazando a Pisador, el poni.","Huellas de pezuñas, pero también huellas de patas muy grandes","¡Pisador se dirige al norte!"},
[11660]={"Talk to Nothmar","Talk to Cutha","'Surely it does not surprise you that I stood at my post until the very last, when you came for me? This great City I cherish and would defend with my life. It will be hard to leave it behind if I march with you. I will do as Aragorn commands, though.'","'It is a sad day. Many of the finest warriors I have known are slain. I take heart, however, that they live on in their descendents and their heroic deeds. May both go on for many generations to come.'","Talk to  Aragorn","Aragorn can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
Help Aragorn survey the battlefield for the missing and presumed dead of Rohan.","Talk to Wídfara","Complete -- The Aftermath: Dervorin and Rossaran","'Hm... that yielded less than I had hoped. No matter. Can I rely on you to find those still missing or presumed dead?\
\
'Let me think a moment on what must be done.'","Aragorn can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should return to Aragorn and tell him what you learned.","Talk to Duinhir","'I still cannot believe that Forlong and Hirluin are both dead. These are hard, hard times for Gondor.'","Complete -- The Aftermath: Forlong, Golasgil, and Hirluin","Ask Duinhir, Gléowine, Wídfara, Gamling, and Cutha about what they saw of the battle yesterday. They can all be found among the tents of Aragorn's Pavilion.","Talk to Gléowine","You should talk to Éomer and Nothmar, who can be found at Aragorn's Pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","'I can not help you. I still heavily bear the loss of my sons.'","'Théoden, Fastred, Golodir, Halbarad are but a few of the names of those who fell on the battlefield yesterday. Many more of the fallen remain uncounted, and we cannot mourn, remember, or honour them while this is so. \
\
'Please, my friend, go about the pavilion and see what you can learn of the battle. More took place here than any one account can comprehend.'","Talk to Golasgil","Habla con Aragorn","'I tried my hardest to bring Herefara and Herubrand back to the City. Their deaths at the hands of Gothmog's Orcs was a cruel and unwelcome demise. May I repay you many times over for your assistance out there, ${PLAYER}.'","Aragorn has asked you to make a reckoning of those who fell in the Battle of the Pelennor Fields.","Habla con Éomer","'I am sure you fought bravely in battle. How I survived the ordeal, though, I cannot say. This old body has seen more combat than most. I suppose I am very lucky to still be alive.'","'Thank you again for your assistance. I see everyone here preparing for a march to the east. I want to join them on this journey and help where I can.'","Talk to Rossaran","Talk to Ingold","Complete -- The Aftermath: Duilin and Derufin","Talk to Dervorin","'I stayed by the side of Théoden King even after his passing and helped escort his body to Minas Tirith. When I heard that Aragorn had set up an encampment on the Pelennor, I rode out to join him.'","Aragorn can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
Help Aragorn survey the battlefield for the missing and presumed dead of Gondor.","You should talk to Aragorn, who can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","Complete -- Book 7, Chapter 2: The Council of the Captains","'The dead and missing we sought are all accounted for, it seems. I thank you for your assistance in this matter. It is of great importance that the men who fought and died here receive all the honour and diligence that Gondor can grant them.'","You should speak with Rossaran, Dervorin, Golasgil, and Ingold, who can all be found in Aragorn's Pavilion, upon the after-battle Pelennor.","'It is good to see some of the men of Gondor whom we feared lost returned to us... even as my heart is heavy with those we know now to be dead.\
\
'It is time we turned our efforts to the Rohirrim unaccounted for. I have spoken with Lord - I should say King Éomer and have the names of those you should seek.'","Complete -- The Aftermath: Elfmar, Harding, and Torferth","'${PLAYER}, my friend. I have been looking for Harding. He and I were fighting side by side, only to get separated in the fray in the late morning. I thought that we would meet again here at the pavilion, but alas, he is nowhere to be found.'","'${PLAYER}, it has been long since we last spoke. I was unable to ride with the rest of my brethren into battle for it took longer than expected to depart. I can assure you that Beaconwatch is safe in my absence though.\
\
'I expected to make good time on the ride south, only to be thwarted by a group of Uruk-hai. I believe they were tracking the rest of the riders so I diverted my path from theirs to throw them off the trail.\
\
'I rode into battle towards the end, and did my best to take out as many Orcs as I could.'","Talk to Gamling","Complete -- The Aftermath: The Valiant Rohirrim","The Aftermath of Victory","Complete -- The Aftermath: Ingold and Turgon","'I thought I was done for out there. I could only think about how I had let my family down. Now I have been given another chance. I will follow Aragorn to the Black Gate. Let Gondor take the offensive against these Mordor foes.'"},
[11661]={"Habla con Aragorn","Find Dervorin","Find Rossaran","'Both Dervorin and Rossaran are safely returned. I have seen them with my own two eyes. How relieved I am!'","'Thank the stars. It is good to see you. Though I am pinned, I do not believe my leg is broken. If you would assist me, I should be able to make my way back.'","Aragorn can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should return to Aragorn now that Dervorin and Rossaran are found.","Aragorn has asked you to find Dervorin and Rossaran, both presumed to be missing in combat.","The Aftermath: Dervorin and Rossaran","'Dervorin, son of Borhador, and Rossaran, a Swan-knight under Imrahil's command, are unaccounted for. You should search for them at once.'","Search for Dervorin and Rossaran on the after-battle Pelennor.","'You appeared just in time. These Haradrim refused to surrender and, wearied as I am, I fear I might not have handled them on my own.\
\
'I must see my wife Bruidis again. It is what keeps me going. I shall meet you back at the pavilion, my friend.'"},
[11662]={"Identify Duilin","You gently explain that Aragorn has asked Duinhir to identify his sons' bodies.\
\
'I cannot. I have seen so much death. To see theirs... You came to know them well in these last days, did you not? Will you go in my stead?'","You are certain this is the body of Derufin","Habla con Aragorn","You should speak with Duinhir, who can be found at Aragorn's pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","'Many corpses have been recovered from the field, some nearly beyond recognition. I fear that Duilin and Derufin, who were trampled by a Mûmak, may be among them. Would you ask Duinhir if he is willing to identify his sons?'","Search among the slain for Duilin and Derufin's bodies.","Duinhir does not have the strength of mind to identify his sons","Identify Derufin","You are certain this is the body of Duilin","Talk to Duinhir","Aragorn can be found in his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should return to Aragorn now that you have identified Duilin and Derufin.","This is not one of Duinhir's sons","The Aftermath: Duilin and Derufin","'I thank you, ${PLAYER}. I understand that it was a difficult task, but you have shown both discretion and courtesy in seeing it through.'","Help identify the bodies of Duilin and Derufin among those recovered from the field."},
[11663]={"'This is grim indeed. Such great lives lost to evil that lies just beyond those mountains. That is why we march, ${CLASS}. Not just for Gondor, but for Elfmar, Harding, Torferth, and all that fell to the darkness of Mordor.'","Habla con Aragorn","Torferth gave his life to Rohan and Gondor","Elfmar died valiantly","The Aftermath: Elfmar, Harding, and Torferth","You should talk to Aragorn, who can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","'Éomer has informed me that Elfmar, Harding, and Torferth are all missing. While they were all seen on the battlefield, none have reported in to Éomer since we established victory. Find them quickly. I am counting on you.'","Elfmar, Harding, Torferth were last seen somewhere on the Pelennor Fields. Look for them there, after the battle.","Find Torferth","Find Elfmar","Find Harding","Harding slew many before he fell in battle","Aragorn has asked you to find Elfmar, Harding, and Torferth, all presumed to be missing in combat."},
[11664]={"Habla con Aragorn","The Aftermath: Forlong, Golasgil, and Hirluin","'My friend, I am dying. But you could see that for yourself, I suppose. Ah, the good times... the adventures. What I wouldn't give for one more draught of that wine...'\
\
Forlong coughs and tries to laugh through the pain.\
\
'Ah, my friend. Forget wine. Would that I could see Thorongil once more. I would swear... ugh! You must forgive me. I would swear I saw him upon the field of battle beneath the banner of the king. What delusions come upon us when our deaths are nigh!\
\
'And yet, if it were him and he had returned in the hour of glory. Here, take my horn. If Thorongil truly is returned, he will know its sound. He will come. I... ugh! I am sure of it.'","Find Hirluin","Search for Forlong on the after-battle Pelennor.","Find Golasgil","'Forlong, Golasgil, and Hirluin all were lost in the tempest of yesterday's combat. What befell them is unknown, though I fear the worst for Forlong, who was last seen charging at full fury towards a line of Sûhalar.\
\
'Please search for them along the wreckage on the Pelennor.'","You should talk to Aragorn, who stands by Forlong on the after-battle Pelennor.","Aragorn has asked you to find Forlong, Golasgil, and Hirluin, all presumed to be missing in combat.","'I thank you. I bid my old friend a last farewell, too late and yet just in time. I have this memory now, and I shall hold it close to my heart always.'","You have found the spot where Hirluin lies slain.","'The Enemy were everywhere. I did my best to fend them off but I was separated from my allies. I was able to hide here and lose them after I fended off a party of Orcs who tried to ambush me. \
\
'You say it is safe to return now? I will go.'","Forlong lies dying on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
Blow Forlong's horn to summon Thorongil.","Find Forlong","Aragorn arrives swiftly, a look of grave concern on his face, and stands by his old friend one last time","Search for Golasgil and Hirluin on the after-battle Pelennor.","Blow Forlong's horn"},
[11665]={"Find Turgon","Habla con Aragorn","'Ingold has returned, but what of Turgon?'\
\
You tell Aragorn that Turgon was slain.\
\
'Ah, I see. This is grievous news. I have heard much of his heroic deeds at the South-gate and all he did to ensure my safe passage in the fields.'","Search for Ingold and Turgon on the after-battle Pelennor.","Find Ingold","Turgon died with honour, in combat","'Ingold, Captain of the Out-wall, and Turgon, Captain of the South-gate, both remain missing. Imrahil felt sure they had retreated into the City before the start of the battle, but now it seems it was not so. You must add their names to those you seek upon the Pelennor.'","Aragorn can be found in his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.\
\
You should return to Aragorn now that you have found Ingold and Turgon.","Aragorn has asked you to find Ingold and Turgon, both presumed to be missing in combat.","'You have come to assist me in defending the wall? Small Orc groups still linger in pockets. There is much to be done! Why do you stand there? Have you something to say?'\
\
You explain to Ingold that he has been missed and should return to Aragorn's pavilion.\
\
'I will go at once. Surely there I shall find others who will join me in wiping out every last threat to the Rammas wall.'","The Aftermath: Ingold and Turgon"},
[11666]={"'I tried to make it to the city with Herefara and Herubrand. Their deaths were heavy upon me. Slain by foul Orcs! I am hurt, my ankle twisted. I can walk but do not have the strength to carry my friends any further. I did not want to leave their side; not with Orcs roaming about. Thank you for coming and helping finish this task I set out to accomplish.'","'Éomer has provided me a list of names of those known Rohirrim who were slain by the enemy on the Pelennor.'\
\
You explain that you saw Nothmar on the Pelennor with Herefara and Herubrand.\
\
'It seems that Nothmar is still missing. We thought he was in the city but word has come back that he never made it. Please look for him while you are out there. He may yet still be alive.'","Herubrand was slain by Gothmog's Orcs","The Aftermath: The Valiant Rohirrim","Habla con Aragorn","Find Nothmar","Find Déorwine","Grimbold, Déorwine, Dúnhere, Guthláf, Herefara, and Herubrand died on the Pelennor. Nothmar is missing.\
\
Search for the valiant Rohirrim on the Pelennor Fields, after the battle.","Déorwine died protecting King Théoden","Dúnhere was felled by an arrow at Riders' Stand","Find Grimbold","Grimbold heroically attacked a fell-beast in his final moments","You should talk to Aragorn, who can be found at his pavilion on the after-battle Pelennor.","Aragorn has asked you to find the bodies of many Rohirrim who fell in combat, and to search for Nothmar, who was last seen making towards the city.","'I am glad to hear that Nothmar is safe and that his wounds are not serious. The Rohirrim are great warriors. We will need as many as we can muster in the coming days to both protect the city and march with us to the Black Gate.'","Find Dúnhere","Find Herubrand","Herefara was slain by Gothmog's Orcs","Find Guthláf","Find Herefara","Guthláf died protecting King Théoden"},
[11667]={"'¡Qué historia tan deliciosa! Es una lástima que no tenga nada que ver con la cerveza, pero ¿qué se puede hacer? Hay cierto orden de prioridades cuando te unes a la Asociación de la Cerveza, ya sabes. Queremos ocuparnos primero de los asuntos importantes. La cerveza siempre estará ahí después.'","La Asociación de la Cerveza -- Un juego de hostigamiento de hobbits","'¿Ya me han visto? No lo creo... ¡bien! No deben saber que la Asociación de la Cerveza está metiendo las narices, o temo que habrá una guerra total entre nuestras dos ligas.\
\
'Me han enviado en misión para descubrir a qué viene tanto alboroto en el Árbol de la Fiesta este otoño. Parece que hay una nueva puerta, y vi a muchos hobbits entrar... y pocos salir.\
\
'¡Déjale a los hobbits perderse bajo tierra! Esta es una oportunidad de oro para asustarlos sin remedio. Deberías ir a encontrarlos y asustarlos de todas las formas que se te ocurran.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Solo se puede tener una misión del Agujero Embrujado en curso a la vez.</rgb>","A Ráthgeir, un enano bastante malicioso, se le puede encontrar fuera del Agujero Embrujado, escondido detrás de unas cajas.\
\
Deberías contarle a Ráthgeir todas las pequeñas travesuras que hiciste.","Cuéntale a Ráthgeir tus hilarantes correrías","'¿No será divertido hacer chillar a esos bribones de pies lanudos como niños asustados? ¡Ja, ja!'","Hay hobbits asustados por todo el Agujero Embrujado, y seguramente hay una manera de aterrorizarlos, porque es muy gracioso.\
\
Deberías hostigar y acosar a los hobbits.","Hobbits aterrorizados y aturdidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gasta trucos para asustar a los hobbits en el Agujero Embrujado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ráthgeir, miembro de la Asociación de la Cerveza, desea continuar el legado de su asociación en el Agujero Embrujado. Esta oportunidad de gastar bromas a los hobbits no puede dejarse escapar.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el evento con el que está asociada. </rgb>"},
[11668]={"'¿Cómo te va, ${CLASS}? ¿Te interesa un verdadero desafío de bebida para la Asociación Cervecera? En este momento tenemos una campaña en el Pueblo de Bree, con la esperanza de conseguir reclutas en una de las ciudades cerveceras más famosas que conocemos.\
\
'Deberás comenzar en el Póney Pisador. Un buen hombre llamado Bjarni está a cargo del primer desafío en esa excelente posada. A partir de allí, iniciarás un recorrido por las muchas estaciones que tenemos repartidas por Bree.\
\
'¡Buena suerte, mi ${RACE}! No será fácil superar el desafío en el tiempo que se te conceda.'","Habla con Bjarni en el Póney Pisador","El Desafío de la Asociación Cervecera: Introducción","Bjarni se encuentra en la posada del Póney Pisador, en Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Bjarni si deseas unirte formalmente a la Asociación Cervecera.","'Bjarni se encuentra en el Póney Pisador, en la ciudad de Bree. Deberías poder comenzar el Desafío de la Asociación Cervecera cuando llegues allí.'","'Así que deseas unirte a la Asociación Cervecera, ¿eh? Entonces has llegado al lugar indicado si quieres sumergir la barba en excelentes brebajes... en sentido figurado, claro está.\
\
'¡Te doy la bienvenida a la primera ronda del Desafío de la Asociación Cervecera! Tendrás un tiempo limitado para completar cada objetivo, lo que te llevará a realizar un buen recorrido por Bree, donde procuramos ganar nuevos reclutas para competir con la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
'¡Buena suerte! Cuando terminemos de hablar, no te quedará mucho tiempo para completar este desafío y pasar al siguiente.'","Todo lo que la Liga de las Posadas puede hacer, la Asociación Cervecera quiere hacerlo mejor.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>"},
[11669]={"'¡Date prisa, ${PLAYER}! ¡No queda mucho tiempo!'","Bebe cervezas (5/6)","Bebiste una cerveza (3/6)","Bebiste una cerveza (5/6)","Bebe cervezas (0/6)","La Asociación Cervecera busca ganar reclutas en las Tierras de Bree para competir más que nunca con la Liga de las Posadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro de misiones cuando finalice el festival actual.</rgb>","Finn se encuentra en Entibo, cerca de Bree.\
\
Deberías hablar con Finn para continuar el Desafío de la Asociación Cervecera en su local de degustación.","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","Las cervezas se encuentran en el centro de Entibo.\
\
Finn te ha desafiado a beber seis cervezas antes de que se agote el tiempo.","Bebe cervezas (1/6)","Bebe cervezas (2/6)","Bebiste una cerveza (4/6)","Bebiste una cerveza (6/6)","Finn se encuentra en el centro de Entibo.\
\
