[11700]={"Talk to Kyrstig","You show Kyrstig the note left by Ausma.\
\
'She went in there by herself, and told us to stay here! But is that really the right thing to do?'","Troubling portents abound! Where is Ausma?","Ausma has decided that stopping the Angmarim cult from raising the entirety of the Houses of Rest in undeath is to be top priority.","'I have seen enough to make a decision: this Angmarim cult has become our top priority. There are many Longbeard ancestors entombed in the Houses of Rest, and we cannot allow them to be drafted into an army of the dead. I am sending you and my apprentices to deal with this matter at once. You will split up and attack each tomb at the same time, preventing any of these Angmarim snakes from slithering away! I will keep watch on Shakhajât in the meantime, and warn you should the hobgoblins move to assist the cultists. Have you any questions?'","The Apprentices Attack","Complete 'Instance: The Apprentices Attack'","It is time for you to carry out Ausma's plan.","'When you are ready to depart, the four of you will attack at once. We will nip this wight problem in the bud.'","My scouts,\
\
Your attack on the Angmarim has proven distraction enough to set my own plan into motion. I am going into Shakhajât alone. If we are fortunate, I will return with the warlord's head. You three are to stay put!\
\
Ausma","Talk to Krystig","'Molkha and Klúso were right! Ausma is gone! Look around and see if you can find any sign of where she went. I really hope something horrible hasn't happened....'","Kyrstig awaits your unhappy tidings.","Find a clue to Ausma's whereabouts"},
[11701]={"You and Baradal survived one encounter with the warg chieftain, Ránulur, but another may be unavoidable, and un-survivable.","Baradal has been taken to the Galadhrim camp on the border of Lothlórien.\
\
You should talk to Baradal.","Talk to Baradal","Baradal is now free, but she is injured from the warg attack.\
\
You should talk to Baradal to begin Instance: Dawn's Arrival.","Baradal looks at you dejectedly. You believe Elrond was correct, she is disheartened to have nearly failed in her mission.\
\
'This is where we part ways, ${PLAYER}. I am to rest and heal in Caras Galadhon until I am ready for travel. If all goes well, I will have recovered enough to continue to Minas Tirith with the wedding party.'\
\
You try to assuage her fears by saying some kind words. You also tell her you believe that few others would have survived the encounter with Ránulur. Her expression brightens slightly.\
\
'Perhaps you are right. The power of Lady Galadriel herself was required to turn the beast. Lady Arwen's family has done so much for me, so I feel I must do the best I can in my service to them. Yet I am still young, and have experienced little combat with the forces of evil in the world. My abilities will improve, with time.\
\
'I am glad to have finally met you, ${PLAYER}. We will meet again. Of that, I am sure.'","Baradal seems steady, but you can tell she is upset and attempting to suppress her emotions.\
\
'I can recall little, but I do remember the massive warg attacking us. It dragged me by the leg. I am not sure I can walk or be of much use in a fight. Forgive me, ${PLAYER}, I let my guard down and now we are in grave danger.'","Complete: 'Instance: Dawn's Arrival'","'I can hear the warg chieftain approaching. He is close. Prepare yourself!'","The Approach of Dawn"},
[11702]={"El río supone una barrera natural contra incursiones desde esta dirección","Esta pendiente asciende hacia las ruinas de la ciudad, ya repletas de enemigos","Encuentra el puente al norte de Caras Gelebren","Ilarion te ha pedido que explores varios accesos a Caras Gelebren: el puente al norte, la orilla del río al suroeste y la colina en pendiente al sudeste.","'Es bueno que los accesos a Caras Gelebren estén en su mayoría libres de enemigos, pero mi corazón se aflige al saber que Uruks y otros enemigos similares ya acechan los caminos de la ciudad.\
\
'Gracias por tus esfuerzos en favor de mi pueblo.'","Habla con Ilarion en Echad Terthas","Ilarion está en Echad Terthas, esperando tu informe.","Encuentra la pendiente al sudeste de Echad Terthas","'Caras Gelebren yace en ruinas, pero es un lugar de gran importancia para los Elfos, y no deberíamos permitir que Uruks u otras criaturas odiables mancillen sus antaño orgullosos senderos.\
\
'¿Puedo pedirte que explores varios de los accesos a la ciudad? Hay un puente al noreste y una orilla del río al suroeste, y cada uno de ellos podría ser utilizado por nuestros enemigos para sorprendernos. También hay una colina en pendiente al sudeste que asciende hasta la propia Caras Gelebren, y esa también debería ser explorada.'","Encuentra la orilla del río al suroeste de Echad Terthas","'¿Puedo pedirte que explores varios de los accesos a la ciudad? Hay un puente al noreste y una orilla de río al suroeste, y cada uno de ellos podría ser utilizado por nuestros enemigos para sorprendernos. También hay una colina en pendiente al sudeste que asciende hasta la propia Caras Gelebren, y esa también debería ser explorada.'","Los Accesos a Caras Gelebren","Ilarion desea que explores los accesos a Caras Gelebren.","El puente está libre de amenazas desde el norte... por ahora"},
[11703]={"Gertheryg derrotados en Maethad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La Arena de Maethad","Derrota gertheryg en Maethad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Has reducido sus números? ¡Bien! ¡Ah, un golpe fuerte contra Maethad! Ahora podemos centrar nuestra atención en quienes dirigen el entrenamiento.'","'¡Ah, te doy la bienvenida! ¡Es bueno contar con aliados inesperados en nuestra lucha por sobrevivir! Parece que —tras muchos años ocultos bajo la sombra de Angmar— por fin podemos contraatacar.\
\
'En este asunto, quizás puedas ayudar. Al norte y al este hay un lugar llamado \\qMaethad.\\q Es una gran arena donde los de la especie troll, especialmente los gertheryg, se entrenan para el combate. Quienes sobreviven en la arena pasan a liderar y entrenar a otros en Angmar. Atacar esta arena sería un golpe a la capacidad de Angmar para formar y entrenar su ejército.\
\
'Para acabar con esta amenaza, primero debemos derrotar a quienes se entrenan dentro de los muros de la arena, y luego podremos aplastar a quienes dirigen los entrenamientos. Ve y reduce el número de gertheryg y trolls dentro de Maethad.'","'Maethad se encuentra al norte y al este. Si tenemos alguna esperanza de acabar con la amenaza de Maethad, primero debemos derrotar a algunos de los gertheryg y trolls que se entrenan allí.'","Trolls derrotados en Maethad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota trolls en Maethad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Al noreste de Gabilshathûr hay un lugar llamado \\qMaethad\\q. Aquí, los trolls y sus maestros gorthorog se entrenan para luchar y liderar los ejércitos de Angmar.","La arena de Maethad está al norte y al este de Gabilshathûr.\
\
Hwati te ha pedido que encuentres la arena y reduzcas el número de gertheryg y trolls que se entrenan allí.","Hwati está de regreso en Gabilshathûr, al oeste y al sur de Maethad.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a varios gertheryg y trolls, deberías regresar con Hwati."},
[11704]={"'Thank you for this spear, ${PLAYER}. The shaft of my old one had been cracked for some time.'","The blacksmith's forge is in Eaworth, near the Mead Hall.\
\
Goldwine asked you to forge spears for the guards of Eaworth.","The guards of Eaworth can be found throughout the city.\
\
Goldwine asked you to bring the spears you crafted to the guards of Eaworth.","Talk to Goldwine","'Have you anything for me?'","'I am impressed by your courage, ${PLAYER}. The Vale has become a dangerous place, and you braved it to bring us the materials we need to arm ourselves for the siege.\
\
'If you are willing, I have one more task for you. Use the ore and branches you gathered to craft spears at the blacksmith's forge.\
\
'When this is done, deliver the spears to the guards throughout the city, then return to me.'","'This, at least, is a sign that we will defend ourselves if attacked. I only hope that Lord Ingmar convinces his father to take swifter action.'","'Have you something for me?'","Delivered spears (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Be of good cheer, ${PLAYER}! This spear shall skewer Orcs before long!'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I was in need of a fresh spear!'","'A fresh spear... that is well. We shall soon be overrun by Orcs.'","'Thank you for your services, ${PLAYER}. We shall be prepared for whatever course of action Reeve Ingbert decides upon.'","Deliver spears (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Impressed by your courage and willingness to assist the people of Eaworth, Goldwine has decided to offer you another task.","Craft spears for the guards of Eaworth","Goldwine stands guard near the blacksmith's forge in Eaworth.\
\
You should let Goldwine know that you have delivered the spears to the guards of Eaworth.","The Armourer's Assistant"},
[11712]={"Habla con Wingard Barroso","Wingard está revisando los textos que has recuperado cuando de repente se pone a cantar desafinando y a bailar con torpeta.\
\
'¡Oh! ¡Ayudante! ¡Estás aquí todavía!\
\
...\
\
\
'No has visto u oído nada de eso.\
\
...\
\
'Ajam.\
\
'¡Ayudante! He hecho un descubrimiento incríble. Un arbusto que crece en esta zona era utilizado como hierba culinaria. \
Recogeré un poco en mi camino de vuelta a Gamwich y haré algunos platos de prueba. Te pediría que recogieras una cantidad mayor y me la lleves a Gamwich.'","Recoge algunas hierbas cerca del río al este de Gamwich. Llévalas de vuelta a Wingard Barroso en el pueblo.","Recoge hierbas de Gamwich (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wingard acepta el puñado de hierbas, toma una, y frota la hoja entre el pulgar y el índice. El aroma que percibes es amargo y vegetal, pero pronto da paso a un dulzor profundo con una suave nota de pimienta de fondo. E igual de rápido, el aroma se va.\
\
'Los platos de prueba que preparé fueron un fracaso absoluto. Horrorosos y... y viscosos, si pueden llamarse así. Pero el aroma es embriagador, ¿no? Quizá esto no se usaba en la comida como tal, sino como un aroma para disfrutarlo antes o después de la comida. Quizá hay técnicas que pueden extraer apropiadamente el sabor de esta hierba.'\
\
Wingard sujeta el manojo de hierbas como un niño que sujeta un nuevo juguete.\
\
Ayudante, me entristece decir que este es el fin de nuestra relación comercial. Al menos de momento. Si mi investigación da lugar a un nuevo y famoso plato, me aseguraré de darte crédito por tu contribución. Quizá encuentre una forma de meter tu nombre en el nombre del plato.\
\
'¿Cómo era tu nombre? ¿${PLAYER}?\
\
'Mmm... en cualquier caso, gracias de nuevo, y espero verte pronto.'","El aroma de almuerzos pasados","Hierbas de Gamwich recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Wingard Barroso está de vuelta en Gamwich.\
\
Vuelve con Wingard Barroso.","Wingard Barroso necesita ayuda para reunir ingredientes."},
[11713]={"Vuelve con Waltney Alboespino III","Se puede recoger carne de jabalí cazando en el Ángulo.\
\
Waltney Alboespino III te ha pedido que recojas carne fresca de jabalí para ayudar a llenar su despensa antes de que lleguen sus padres.","Waltney Alboespino III, apodado Espino, está en Tornhad.\
\
Deberías llevarle la carne fresca a Espino.","'¡Bien hallado! Sí, soy Waltney Alboespino III. Sin embargo, me llaman Espino'.\
\
Le hablas de la inminente llegada de sus padres.\
\
'¡¿Qué?! ¿Mis padres vienen? ¡¿Hoy?! ¡Esos viejos locos! ¡Les dije que se quedaran en Bree, donde estarían a salvo! Cielos. ¡Esto es terrible! Pero discúlpame. Mi casa no está ni mucho menos lista para alojar a esos dos tiquismiquis. ¡Si mi madre llegara y viera mis calcetines agujereados colgados junto al fuego, me lo reprocharía toda la vida!\
\
'Te agradezco que los hayas ayudado a cruzar el Ángulo. ¡Menuda pesadilla! Dime, ¿estarías dispuesto a ayudarme a mí también? ¡Debo salir corriendo a mi casa y limpiar todo lo que pueda, y mi despensa está más vacía que si hubiera tenido hobbits de invitados! Si pudieras cazar un poco para mí y traerme algo de carne de jabalí, ¡te lo agradecería de verdad!'","'Has hecho mucho por nosotros, pero me pregunto si tendrías tiempo para otra tarea. Tornhad no está muy lejos, pero con Waltney saltando ante cada sombra que cree que es un fantasma, nuestra marcha se retrasará un poco aún. Si por casualidad te acercas al pueblo, por favor, avisa a nuestro hijo Waltney Junior de que estamos a punto de llegar. No quisiera que se preocupara'.","Waltney Alboespino III está en Tornhad.\
\
Garan Alboespino te ha pedido que avises a su hijo de que sus padres están a punto de llegar a Tornhad.","Recoge carne fresca (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Waltney Alboespino III","'¡Ah, hola! Por favor, dime que tienes algo que pueda servir para cenar. Madre mía. ¡Esto es muchísimo mejor de lo que podría haber hecho yo! ¡Muchas gracias! Todavía tengo mucho que hacer antes de que mi casa esté lista para mis padres, ¡pero al menos ahora la cena está solventada! Bueno, si me disculpas, aún tengo mucho que hacer'.","La llegada de los Alboespino","Waltney y Garan Alboespino se acercan a Tornhad, pero ¿está su hijo, Waltney Alboespino III, preparado para su llegada?","Carne fresca recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[11714]={"'Did something disrupt your hunting? I would have expected the job finished with a bit more haste, but I suppose I cannot expect you to possess the speed of a professional, such as myself.\
\
'Nonetheless, the task is done, and you are still whole and hale. I wager you are ready for a more difficult challenge.'","The Arrogant Huntsman","Collect hides from Norcrofts brown-bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The renowned huntsman Caddabrand is seeking skilled adventurers to become his apprentice and share in his profits.","Norcrofts brown bears dwell among the trees and rocks east along the river.\
\
Caddabrand has asked you to collect hides from brown bears to prove that you are capable of more profitable ventures.","Caddabrand waits at his encampment, west and south of the river crossing.\
\
You have collected the brown bear-hides sought by the scout Caddabrand.","'You stand before the esteemed Caddabrand, renowned tracker, game hunter, and personal scout to Reeve Athelward. I would like to offer you a rare and wonderful opportunity: the chance to become my apprentice! Working for Athelward awards much privilege and prestige... something a modest ${RACE} such as yourself would be hard pressed to find elsewhere. Prove your abilities to me, and there will be profit in this for us all.\
\
'Let us begin with a simple task for an aspiring tracker. The hides of the Norcrofts brown bears can be sold to the nearby merchants for a meaningful sum, but convincing a bear to part with his hide is not without considerable danger. Gather a supply of bear hides and prove that you are more than a mere novice at hunting.'","Collected hides from Norcrofts brown-bears (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Caddabrand with the brown bear-hides"},
[11715]={"You have found Belhax's wine delivery, but not him. A trail of wine droplets leads you further around the Tor-gardens pool.\
\
You should follow it.","Akhamâl has told you to check the north-western entrance of the Dahâl Huliz for Belhax.","The droplet trail seems to loop around part of the pool","This must be Belhax!","After you relay the story of Belhax and the wine, Akhamâl huffs in amusement.\
\
'I am equal parts disgruntled, amused, and impressed. He managed to drink a good amount of wine before falling asleep.\
\
'Thank you for checking on him, and for giving me a story to tell my friends. For now, however, it is time that I woke him. He has a mess to clean up.'","You have found a leaking crate at the Dahâl Huliz's north-western entrance. Belhax is nowhere in sight.\
\
You should examine it and the puddle it's leaving.","You have found Belhax at the gazebo in the center of the Tor-gardens pool!\
\
You should try to talk to him.","Despite your best efforts to wake him, the assistant seems to have fallen into a deep sleep.\
\
Next to him lies a discarded, empty wine bottle. The glass on its side has cracked; perhaps this was what caused the puddle next to the crate. Rather than let the wine go to waste, Belhax might have run off to drink the rest.\
\
It might be kindest to let him continue sleeping while you report back to Akhamâl.","You spot a trail of wine droplets leading north-east...","Akhamâl's assistant has not returned with a wine delivery.","Examine the crate","The Assistant and the Wine","'Where is that boy...?\
\
'You -- on your way here, did you happen across young man about this tall, carrying a crate? Goes by the name of Belhax? No? He should be here by now! We will not have enough wine for arena-goers at this rate....\
\
'If you would like some extra coin, I will pay you to find him for me. First, you should make sure he is not already at the arena's north-western entrance.'","You've found Belhax safe and sound.\
\
You should tell Akhamâl back at the Dahâl Huliz.","The crate holds bottles of wine sourced from local shops","Talk to Belhax","Examine the puddle","The puddle smells distinctly of fermented grapes","You find an unattended crate leaking some kind of liquid...","Follow the wine droplet trail","Check the Dahâl Huliz's north-western entrance","Talk to Akhamâl at the Dahâl Huliz"},
[11717]={"'So, you represent Andras, do you, duvodiad? I hope he has brought something worth selling this time. I do not tolerate my time being spent and my money wasted.'","The Auctioneer","Bedwur is in the centre of Avardin at the auction-platform.\
\
Andras asked you to speak with Bedwur regarding the auction.","Avardin is run by Bedwur, a leader among the Ox-clan who runs the auctions and controls the local economy.","'Bedwur will likely ask you to do some small tasks. I would be grateful if you could, while I prepare things here.'","Talk to Bedwur in Avardin","'You have done much good work to help me, and I am very grateful for that, but I fear the most difficult parts are still ahead of us. Bedwur is the auctioneer here... he is the local leader of the Ox-clan, and a very powerful man. He is also as corrupt as they come, having long ago given his will to Saruman.\
\
'Unfortunately, he is an evil I must deal with if I am to pay off my debts. Any transaction of noticeable size must go through his auction, and he happily takes a price from each lot.\
\
'I need some time to take inventory and get everything cleaned and ready for sale. While I do that, you go talk with Bedwur and secure a position in the upcoming auction. You can find him near the centre of town by the auction-platform.'"},
[11721]={"A villager wants to know what might be found at the nearby bandit camp.\
\
Investigate the bandit camp west of Dínadab.","Tell Peran that you have examined the supplies at the camp.","'Just as I thought: they have barely anything to their name but the clothes on their backs. Why continue to live out there when they could come home? Lamedon has no shortage of honest work that needs doing.'","'Some bandits have made camp west of here. They have not bothered us here in Dínadab in some time. Could you check on the camp for me? Tell me what you find.'","Someone has laid out good clothing and leather armour","The Bandit Camp's Ruins","Examine the barricade","A villager wants to know if there are salvageable materials in the nearby bandit camp.","You aren't entirely sure what this barricade is meant to accomplish","Examine the lumber pile","Examine the cloth","Talk to Peran","The smell of rot wafts up from the pile of lumber. It is of no use to anyone"},
[11723]={"A particularly mischievous wolverine has stolen honey cakes from Hunulf on several occasions.","'The mischievous creature has met its end? While I do not celebrate its demise, I am thankful for a just resolution.'","Return to Hunulf","Defeated Hunulf's Bane","Defeat Hunulf's Bane","The Bane of Hunulf's Existence","A particularly mischievous wolverine has stolen honey cakes from Hunulf on several occasions. He hopes for a just resolution to his problem.","You should return to Hunulf, who can be found in Skoghús, in the Thornholt woods.","You should find and defeat the wolverine."},
[11726]={"'¡Qué emoción, ${PLAYER}! Nunca había estado tan cerca de un huargo. Sería difícil estar más cerca sin terminar directamente dentro de su barriga.'","'Se me ocurrió algo mientras explorábamos las Viejas Madrigueras y la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, ${PLAYER}. Hay un puesto avanzado de Rohan no muy lejos de aquí, pero Maervadhor no sugirió que visitáramos a su gente. Son vecinos, pero me pregunto si habrá algún malentendido entre ellos.\
\
'Habría sido grosero preguntarle, así que no lamento no haber investigado más. Pero creo que me gustaría visitar a esos vecinos cuando volvamos a ponernos en marcha. ¡Sería bueno obtener una imagen completa de la situación aquí a lo largo del Gran Río para mi libro!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Amigos Inusuales' (Nivel recomendado: 72)</rgb>\
'","Encuentra la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, al sureste de Haldirith","'¿Encontraste los ingredientes? Me alegra ver que no te llevó demasiado tiempo. Muele los juncos y el barro hasta obtener una pasta que forme un pigmento oscuro.'","Habla con Maervadhor en Haldirith","Ahora que tiene el estómago lleno, Bingo está entusiasmado por continuar su viaje hacia las tierras al sur de Lothlórien, a lo largo de las orillas del Gran Río.","'¡Qué caminata tan agradable y enérgica! Ya he notado un cambio en el paisaje al dejar atrás el Bosque de Oro. Los árboles aquí siguen siendo hermosos, pero son más pequeños y su belleza es diferente a la de los de Lothlórien propiamente dicha. ¡Debo escribir mis impresiones antes de que las olvide!\
\
Bingo saca su frasco de tinta, quita el tapón y mira dentro con consternación.\
\
'¡Mi tintero se ha quedado casi seco, ${PLAYER}! Solo queda tinta suficiente para la descripción más breve, ¡y eso no será suficiente!\
\
'¿Recuerdas los libros que me trajiste de Pennasseth? Uno de ellos hablaba largamente sobre el arte de los elfos. Ellos deben saber una o dos cosas sobre la importancia de la tinta en las tareas creativas, y quizá puedan prestarnos lo equivalente a un tintero. ¡Pregunta a la gente de aquí en Haldirith y averigua si alguno tiene inclinación artística y puede ayudarnos, ${PLAYER}!\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Bert Bartolín ha llegado al puesto avanzado de Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río.</rgb>\
'","Busca a un elfo en Haldirith dispuesto a ayudarte con la falta de tinta de Bingo","Recolecta juncos de ribera al noreste de Haldirith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bingo está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río.\
\
Has repuesto la tinta de Bingo y deberías averiguar qué desea hacer a continuación.","'¿Bingo quiere conocer lugares interesantes para explorar a lo largo del Gran Río? Bueno, hay algunos sitios que podrían resultarle emocionantes, aunque no puedo garantizar su seguridad. Supongo que, si ha llegado tan lejos de su hogar, debe ser un aventurero formidable... o viajar en compañía de uno, ¿verdad, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'Hacia el sur encontrarás las Viejas Madrigueras, que antaño fueron el hogar de criaturas pacíficas. Han sido tomadas recientemente por feroces huargos, así que si Bingo desea verlas deberá hacerlo con precaución.\
\
'Al sureste encontrarás la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, donde vive un enorme oso de pelaje gris y corazón negro. Sería prudente mantenerse alejado de Fauces-Hediondas, pero es de tamaño descomunal y un encuentro con él podría servir para un capítulo emocionante en el libro de Bingo.'","Maervadhor recomendó a Bingo explorar las Viejas Madrigueras, al sur de Haldirith, y la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, al sureste de Haldirith, si busca aventuras dignas de ser escritas.","Muele los ingredientes hasta obtener pigmento usando la piedra de molienda en Haldirith","Mueles los ingredientes hasta obtener un pigmento oscuro","'¿Cómo va la fabricación de la tinta, ${PLAYER}?'","'Los elfos de aquí deben saber bien la importancia de la tinta en los trabajos creativos, y quizá puedan prestarnos lo equivalente a un tintero. ¡Pregunta a algunos de los habitantes de Haldirith y ve si alguno tiene inclinación artística y puede ayudarnos, ${PLAYER}!'","Maervadhor está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.\
\
Bingo quiere pedir a Maervadhor recomendaciones de lugares emocionantes para visitar a lo largo del Gran Río.","La Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas apesta a oso y carne en descomposición. Bingo escribe frenéticamente.","Lleva la tinta a Bingo en Haldirith","Las Orillas del Gran Río","Maervadhor te ha pedido reunir varios ingredientes que puedes usar para hacer una tinta de alta calidad. El siguiente paso consiste en molerlos hasta obtener un pigmento en una piedra de Haldirith.","Bingo está en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.","Las Viejas Madrigueras han sido invadidas por huargos. Bingo escribe frenéticamente.","Juncos de ribera recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hubiera sido más conveniente pedir prestado un tintero, pero esto funcionará igual de bien. ¡Y quizá incluso sea divertido!'","'Sí, parece haber quedado muy bien. ¡Tienes talento para la fabricación de tinta!'","¡Este lugar huele horrible, ${PLAYER}! ¡Voy a tener que esforzarme para encontrar suficientes sinónimos de 'maloliente'!","Añades el pigmento al agua, formando una tinta espesa","'¡Mi estómago está deliciosamente lleno y estoy listo para continuar nuestro viaje! Hablé con algunos de los elfos de aquí y me contaron sobre un pequeño puesto avanzado al sur de Lothlórien. El puesto se llama Haldirith, y su gente puede guiarnos mientras avanzamos hacia el sur por las orillas del Gran Río.\
\
'¿Quieres partir, ${PLAYER}? ¡Tengo mucha curiosidad por ver el paisaje y espero un poco más de sol que el que nos dio el lúgubre dosel del Bosque Negro!'","Bingo ha decidido viajar por las orillas del Gran Río, al sur de Lothlórien, y quiere encontrarse contigo en el puesto élfico de Haldirith, en Thinglad.","'Ahora que has preparado un pigmento oscuro, deberías añadirlo al cubo de agua para formar la tinta que Bingo ha pedido. ¡Ya casi está!'","'¡Estoy listo para continuar nuestro viaje! Hablé con algunos de los elfos de aquí y me contaron sobre un pequeño puesto avanzado al sur de Lothlórien. El puesto se llama Haldirith, y su gente puede guiarnos mientras avanzamos hacia el sur por las orillas del Gran Río.\
\
'¿Estás listo para ir, ${PLAYER}? ¡Tengo mucha curiosidad por ver el paisaje, y espero un poco más de sol que bajo el lúgubre dosel del Bosque Negro!'","Barro oscuro recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Bingo en Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río","Habla con Bingo en Haldirith","'¡Qué emoción, ${PLAYER}! Nunca había estado tan cerca de un huargo. Sería difícil estar más cerca sin terminar directamente dentro de su barriga.\
\
'¡Te veré de vuelta en Haldirith!'","'¡Este lugar huele horrible, ${PLAYER}! ¡Voy a tener que esforzarme para encontrar suficientes sinónimos de 'maloliente'!\
\
'¡Te veré de vuelta en Haldirith!'","Bingo te ha pedido que hables con los elfos de Haldirith, en Thinglad junto al Gran Río, sobre la posibilidad de pedir prestado un tintero.","Los juncos de ribera y el barro oscuro se pueden encontrar al noreste de Haldirith, junto a las orillas del Gran Río.","Maervadhor te explicó el proceso de fabricación de la tinta, y el siguiente paso es añadir el pigmento que creaste al cubo de agua cercano.","Agrega el pigmento que creaste al cubo de agua en Haldirith","'Hacia el sur encontrarás las Viejas Madrigueras, que antaño fueron hogar de criaturas pacíficas de la naturaleza. ¡Recientemente han sido tomadas por feroces huargos, así que si Bingo desea verlas deberá hacerlo con cautela!\
\
'Al sureste encontrarás la Guarida de Fauces-Hediondas, donde vive un enorme oso de pelaje gris y corazón negro. Sería prudente mantenerse alejado de Fauces-Hediondas, pero es de tamaño descomunal y un encuentro con él podría servir de emocionante capítulo para el libro de Bingo.'","Recolecta barro oscuro al noreste de Haldirith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No tengo un tintero para tu amigo, pues este puesto es un lugar de vigilancia y no de creación, pero quizá aún pueda ayudar. Verás, conozco una forma de preparar una tinta de alta calidad con ingredientes que se encuentran a lo largo de las orillas del Anduin.\
\
'Si mueles cierto tipo de barro oscuro con unos juncos especiales de la ribera, puedes obtener un pigmento espeso. Añadir agua a este pigmento producirá una tinta de gran calidad que servirá bien a tu amigo. Si sigues mis instrucciones, podrá volver a escribir muy pronto.'","'Voy a ponerme a escribir de nuevo. ¿Podrías preguntarle a Maervadhor si hay algún lugar de interés cercano que encaje bien en mi libro? Asegúrate de decirle que estoy escribiendo un relato que debe ser a la vez emocionante y verdadero, ${PLAYER}, ¡así que espero que cualquier lugar que sugiera sea apto para la aventura!'","'¿Está casi lista la tinta?'","'¡Qué tinta de alta calidad! ¡No puedo creer que hayas podido hacer una tinta tan buena tan rápido y con ingredientes tan comunes! ¡Realmente debe ser la inventiva de los elfos!\
\
'Voy a ponerme a escribir de nuevo. ¿Podrías preguntarle a Maervadhor si hay algún lugar de interés cercano que encaje bien en mi libro? Asegúrate de decirle que estoy escribiendo un relato que debe ser a la vez emocionante y verdadero, ${PLAYER}, ¡así que espero que cualquier sitio que sugiera sea digno de aventura!'","'¡Es un placer conocerte, ${PLAYER}! Y comprendo bien la situación de tu amigo Bingo. ¡Que la tinta se acabe mientras las ideas siguen fluyendo es una desgracia que conozco demasiado bien!\
\
'Debo admitir que no tengo un tintero para tu amigo, pues este puesto es un lugar de vigilancia y no de creación, pero quizá aún pueda ayudar. Verás, conozco una forma de preparar una tinta de alta calidad con ingredientes que se encuentran a lo largo de las orillas del Anduin.\
\
'Si mueles cierto tipo de barro oscuro con unos juncos especiales de la ribera, puedes obtener un pigmento espeso. Añadir agua a este pigmento producirá una tinta de gran calidad que servirá bien a tu amigo. Si sigues mis instrucciones, podrá volver a escribir muy pronto.'","Encuentra las Viejas Madrigueras, al sur de Haldirith"},
[11728]={"Gorgar's forces flock to Durshulot, waving his banners proudly. Rékkur has an idea for what to do with them.","Burned Orkish banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Banners of Gorgar","Rékkur is stationed in Aslíf and will want to hear that the deed is done.","Talk to Rékkur in Aslíf","'Magnificent job, my friend. I could see the smoke from here. And who knows? Perhaps we'll get our hands on Gorgar soon enough!'","'The banners hanging in Durshulot mock us. The Orcs believe that those banners, and Gorgar himself, remain untouchable.\
\
'We may not be able to deal with Gorgar today, but we can burn those banners at the very least. Head north-west to Durshulot. Show the Orcs that they are mistaken!'","Burn Orkish banners (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Durshulot lies on the middle tier to the north-west of Aslíf.\
\
Rékkur believes that burning the Orkish banners at Durshulot will diminish the morale among Gorgar's forces."},
[11730]={"Durshâtaz can be found at Krul Lugu, below Iavassúl's Watch.\
\
Iavssúl has asked you to find and defeat the Orc-leader Durshâtaz. He suggests trying to attract his attention as he roams between the two fortresses.","Defeated Durshâtaz","Iavassúl is at Iavassúl's Watch, above Krul Lugu.\
\
You should return to Iavassúl with news of your victory.","'The Orcs of Krul Lugu are disheartened, and they will collapse completely, I believe, if their chieftain is slain.'","'It seems that there is one thing left to hold the Orcs in check from a complete rout -- one powerful Orc-leader with a cruel whip and the strength to bend the others to his will.\
\
'If you can find and defeat this Durshâtaz, as he is called, the final pin holding the forts of Krul Lugu together will be removed, and we shall be free to move as we wish against them.\
\
'One of my scouts tells me that Durshâtaz travels frequently between the two encampments, trying to keep his underlings in line. If you can catch him in the open, you might be able to defeat him before help arrives.'","A powerful Orc named Durshâtaz keeps his underlings in Taur Morvith in line with strength and a cruel lash, but without his domineering will to force them to battle, the Orcs there will likely fall to chaos, giving the Elves a free hand to act in the area.","'Durshâtaz is dead? Elbereth be praised! Without his strength to hold them together, the Orcs are now bereft of leadership and at our mercy. You have opened the way for us, ${PLAYER}...now we shall discover whatever strength they may have been hiding on the other side of that river.\
\
'What is that? Of course there is something over there! Who would build a pair of fortresses to defend a bridge if there was not something of value on the other side?\
\
'I have already had my scouts slip across during the distraction afforded by your previous forays. They should be back shortly.'","Talk to Iavassúl at Iavassúl's Watch","The Barbed Lash","Defeat Durshâtaz"},
[11732]={"Viaja con Faelbenn a los Rammas Deluon","'¿Has reunido a tus aliados? ¿Estamos para partir?'","Faelbenn está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Faelbenn espera hablar contigo de nuevo.","La ira de Mordirith contra los Trév Gállorg no se ha disuadido. Refuerzos de Carn Dûm y Urugarth están tratando de marchar a través del Rammas Deluon hacia el pueblo de Aughaire.","Habla con Faelbenn","La batalla ante el Rammas Deluon","'${PLAYER}, ¡debemos permanecer vigilantes! Angmar ha sufrido muchas pérdidas ahora debido a tu heroísmo y nuestra alianza con los Trév Gállorg, y Mordirith aún busca su venganza.\
\
'Tenemos noticias de que el Falso Rey está enviando refuerzos a través del Rammas Deluon para renovar sus asaltos sobre Aughaire. Hemos establecido un bloqueo del Rammas Deluon, pero esa línea de piedras se ha vuelto intransitable una vez más. Mordirith ha enviado hechiceras para suplicar a los espíritus de las piedras centinelas que fortalezcan sus voluntades.\
\
'Las hechiceras deben ser derrotadas si vamos a movernos contra los refuerzos de Carn Dûm y Urugarth antes de que puedan llegar a Aughaire. Ve, reúne a tus aliados y habla conmigo cuando quieras partir.'","'Tus esfuerzos han contribuido enormemente a nuestra victoria, pero la guerra aún no está ganada, ${PLAYER}. Angmar está debilitado, pero seguirán adelante. Me temo que tu fuerza será necesaria aquí y en otras batallas.'","Faelbenn está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
El montaraz Faelbenn te ha pedido que le ayudes a derrotar a las hechiceras de Angmar que están fortaleciendo las piedras centinelas de Rammas Deluon y a enfrentarte a los refuerzos angmarim a su lado."},
[11733]={"Talk to Corr","'My <rgb=#FF00FF>Fortress upon Frostlake</rgb> is under siege! When the moment is right, we must reclaim my keep!'\
\
'I am the King of Frostbluff, and I decree this!'","The Battle at Frostbluff","Capture the Tower of Grumpwood!","Grumpwood Tower has been secured from the cold!","'My keep is the grand <rgb=#FF00FF>Frostlake Fortress</rgb>! If only we could reclaim this great fortress and restore balance to the kingdom!'\
\
'I am the King of Frostbluff. I have spoken!'","Talk to Liddy","Talk to the Queen of Cluckland","Talk to Griff","'Bok... bok!'","Talk to the children of Winterhome.","Capture Fortress of Frostlake!","Frostlake Fortress has been secured from the cold!","'I can not speak on the queen's behalf for I am merely a squire. I have heard the rumours that a bold ${CLASS} was to assist the <rgb=#FF00FF>Realm of Cluckland</rgb>.\
\
'If you succeed, we shall sing songs of the day!'","'<rgb=#FF00FF>Frostlake Fortress</rgb> is my home! Now it is empty and cold! When the moment is right, we must reclaim my keep!'\
\
'I am the King of Frostbluff, and no one tells me what to do!'","'What an adventure, and with our very own ${CLASS}! This was the best day ever!'","Capture the Keep of Cluckland!","Talk to Una","'${CLASS}, we have been attacked!\
\
'The hardship of building our fortresses has been for naught. Today was to be our yearly tradition, The Battle at Frostbluff, you see. We have been making our forts the best they could be. Now we have had to cancel our throwing of snow and laughter, for a cold and evil wind has come to Winterhome.\
\
'It is too cold to play and throw snow. I do hope that you will be able to help us fight off the cold so that we may have fun on this great winter's day.\
\
'Let us reclaim the <rgb=#FF00FF>Tower of Grumpwood</rgb>!'","Cluckland Keep has been secured from the cold!","¡Un frío terrible ha descendido de las montañas!","Talk to Wyn"},
[11735]={"Anatrâd is in north-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should defeat hobgoblins at Anatrâd.","The ruins of Anatrâd have been overrun by hobgoblins. The ancient fortress is essential to the success of the dwarves.","Hobotrasgos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los hobotrasgos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Battle for Anatrâd","The ruins of Anatrâd have been overrun by hobgoblins."},
[11736]={"Mordirith, el Intendente de Angmar ha regresado, y su ira contra los Montañeses de Aughaire es terrible.","Firingal está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Deberías hablar con Firingal sobre la defensa de Aughaire.","Viaja con Firingal a Aughaire","'Gracias por tu ayuda, ${PLAYER}. Hemos ganado una batalla en Aughaire, pero no podemos relajarnos en nuestra defensa hasta que Angmar sea derrotado.'","Habla con Firingal","La batalla por Aughaire","'¡${PLAYER}, a las armas! ¡Angmar se acerca! El Falso Rey envía un ejército contra Aughaire con gran ira.\
\
'La ira de Mordirith se ha levantado contra los Trév Gállorg y no se calmará hasta que Aughaire quede en ruinas. ¡Debemos atender a la defensa del pueblo!\
\
'Reúne a tus aliados... ¡la lucha será feroz!'","'¿Está tu comunidad reunida? ¿Estás listo para defender Aughaire?'","Firingal está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
El ejército de Mordirith se acerca a Aughaire en las regiones occidentales de Angmar. El montaraz Firingal te ha pedido que ayudes a defender Aughaire."},
[11737]={"Rodelleth is encamped at the captured tower of Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz, east of Ost Galadh.\
\
Fuirgam has asked you to join Rodelleth's forces in battle against the Orcs of Gathbúrz before the gates of the tower of Dol Guldur.","Report to Rodelleth in Gathbúrz","'Once you have completed your tasks here in Emyn Lûm, Rodelleth needs all the soldiers we can muster in Gathbúrz.'","'The battle has been joined upon the slopes above us ${PLAYER}. Fierce Rodelleth leads the Malledhrim in battle against the Orcs encamped in Gathbúrz, and strives to lay siege to the tower itself.\
\
'Ultimately, she has not the Elves to defeat the walls of Dol Guldur, but with the aid of valiant warriors such as yourself, she may inflict grievious harm upon their forces.\
\
'Once you have completed your tasks here, you should join her forces above.'","Fuirgam has asked you to lend your aid to Rodelleth as she launches her assault upon Gathbúrz on the slopes before Dol Guldur.","'Fuirgam has sent more reinforcements? What does he take me for, some delicate maiden in need of heroic rescue?\
\
'Very well then. There are more than enough Orcs to go around, so take your pick - but unless the Lady herself strides forth or Fuirgam provides enough Elves that we can stride over its walls upon our own fallen, we're not likely to breach that tower by force.\
\
'Still, we'll make a merry game of it, and any enemy who does dare emerge will pay swiftly for their folly.'","The Battle for Dol Guldur"},
[11738]={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","Términos definidos (${VALUE}/2)","La batalla por Erebor","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai","Arrastra los estandartes y define tus términos (${VALUE}/2)"},
[11739]={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","La batalla por Erebor","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Términos definidos (${VALUE}/4)","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai","Arrastra los estandartes y define tus términos (${VALUE}/4)"},
[11740]={"Los estandartes orientales bordean las escaleras, cada uno estableciendo un término diferente para la batalla que se llevará a cabo.","Términos definidos (${VALUE}/6)","Arrastra los estandartes y define tus términos (${VALUE}/6)","El ejército oriental ha sido destrozado","Define tus términos antes de comenzar la lucha","Los campeones Olog-hai deben ser derrotados para que se rompa el asedio.","Ha llegado el momento de desafiar a los campeones Olog-hai del ejército oriental. Si pueden ser derrotados de forma convincente, el asedio puede romperse.","Derrota a los campeones Olog-hai","La batalla por Erebor - Desafío","Desafío fallido - Comienza la lucha"},
[11741]={"'I heard Gerja asking you to explore Garânashmar. The Angmarim have squirmed their way into those once-great halls, and sully the floors upon which the line of Forstóri once trod. It would greatly help our cause if, whilst sightseeing in Garânashmar, you were to remove as many of the invaders as you are able.'","Defeat Angmarim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Rúdin is in Bazanmanar in north-eastern Clovengap.\
\
You should tell Rúdin that you have defeated many of the Angmarim.","Return to Rúdin","'Excellent work, my friend! You have made it that much easier for our brethren to take back the gap!'","Defeated Angmarim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Garânashmar perches across Kurdushâlak, in north-western Clovengap.\
\
Rúdin has asked you to defeat Angmarim at Garânashmar.","Garânashmar, the ancient homestead of Forstóri's Line, has been overrun by Angmarim.","The Battle for Garânashmar"},
[11742]={"Defeated Ekhamâti forces on the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield.","Defeat Ekhamâti forces on the battlefield (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'His forces are numerous, but our soldiers are of a greater quality. I would ask you to cut through his lines of Ordâkhai. Plant our banner outside his gates, in his first camp, and just inside the gates. Our troops will be heartened and flood into Nisigurûm. Be the spear-tip, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'My Subuzûri will follow close behind you.'","'I do not long for war, and yet it seems to keep finding me all the same. I tell myself, my shoulders are broad, my back will not break. This is my burden alone.\
\
'Let us meet him then, on the battlefield. We will march south and drive this false Shâr from Imhûlar.'","Mizâdi asks your help in expelling the cruel Bârshud II. War has come to Imhûlar!","Place Mizâdi's standard in the first encampment of Bârshud's forces","Speak with Mizâdi on the battlefield","Place Mizâdi's standard just within the gates of Nisigurûm","'We have lost many good Subuzûri, but now we must press our advantage. We must move into Nisigurûm and find this Bârshud. This snake of Ekhamât will not long survive without its head, and this bloodshed can be brought to a swift conclusion once he is dead.'","Regroup near Mizâdi on the battlefield","Speak with Mizâdi in southern Imhûlar outside Bârshud's camp of Nisigurûm.","Defeat Ekhamâti and plant Mizâdi's banner in each area.","The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 1","Regroup near Mizâdi on the battlefield.","Place Mizâdi's standard outside the gates of Nisigurûm","Speak with Mizâdi in southern Imhûlar outside Nisigurûm"},
[11743]={"Search for Bârshud II near the red tents to the west in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","'No! I don't believe it. What a fool I was!'","Mizâdi asks your help in finding and defeating Bârshud II within Nisigurûm, so that the Ekhamâti forces may crumble and flee with their leader slain.","Continue searching for Bârshud near the eastern tents further in Nisigurûm","Antagâl runs off, wounded, behind the main tent. Pursue him!","'He is not here, you cur! He is too smart for you. He left this small force here to tie up Mizâdi, the pretender. Her army is the largest in Shagâna beside our own. It would have been inconvenient for her to intercept the Shâr as he cuts a glorious path through Khûd Zagin and Ambarûl.\
\
'Ambarûl has grain enough for all of Ekhamât. We never wanted your cursed land. Your soil is fit for nothing but blood and oaths. Your Mizâdi danced right to the tune we played for her.\
\
'I may die, but Ekhamât is forever.'\
\
With those words, Antagâl's body falls back and he is no more.","The Battle for Imhûlar, Part 2","Bârshud is nowhere to be found here","You find no sign of Bârshud here","Defeat Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni!","You see Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni. Defeat him!","Antagâl is wounded. He scuttled behind the main tent in Nisigurûm. Interrogate Antagâl about where Bârshud really is.","Search for Bârshud II near the western tents in Nisigurûm","Continue searching for Bârshud II near the eastern tents further in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","Search for Bârshud II near the main tent in Nisigurûm and challenge him to a duel.","Search for Bârshud II near the main tent in Nisigurûm","Find Mizâdi on the battlefield and give her this grim news","Find Mizâdi on the battlefield and give her this grim news.","Defeat Antagâl, Bârshud's Umûni","Interrogate Antagâl about where Bârshud really is","'We must find Bârshud within the camp. Head towards the back, to the Shâr's tent. If you find him, defeat him. Shout out when you see him. I will be close, and if I hear you, I will close the distance and end his threat myself.\
\
'Now go - we must find him quickly. We are outnumbered, and I fear with each passing moment more of my Subuzûri will fall and this day may be lost.'"},
[11745]={"Akh-gulûkh has asked you to join him and the other Jangovar leaders inside the Utterby Town Hall.\
\
You should speak with Kunchat and enter Instance: The Lone Dwarf.","'Akh-gulûkh has asked to see you both. It seems all your hard work has been noticed! Or you have done something wrong, ha ha! Go inside, and mind yourselves.'","The Battle for Utterby","'Now that their leadership is eliminated, the rest of the Jangovar soldiers will be easily dispatched. Thank you for fighting by my side. And thank Tuhâl for his part in this. Perhaps some Easterlings are worthy of our trust.\
\
'As for Utterby, I am afraid it is not my decision whether or not the peaceful Easterlings stay. This village belongs to the Kingdom of Dale, so you must take up the matter with King Bard. Good luck. I truly do hold sympathy for their plight.'","The dwarf attack on Utterby is imminent. Through your efforts, the innocent Easterlings have fled. The time has come to take on the Jangovar.","Speak with Kunchat to enter Instance: The Lone Dwarf","Lord Náin is outside Utterby.\
\
You should talk to Lord Náin.","Talk to Lord Náin","'What are you waiting for? Go inside!'"},
[11746]={"<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Reunión Inferior. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el sur al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Reunión Superior</rgb>","Con la Sala de Entrada y la Sala de Audiencias conquistadas, podéis comenzar a ascender la Torre y tratar de conquistar la Sala de Reunión Inferior.","La Sala de Entrada está asegurada, y Sigileth se encargará de que nada entre por detrás. El siguiente objetivo es la Sala de Audiencias al otro lado del pasillo.","Reclamar la Sala de Reunión Superior","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Audiencias. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el este al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Reunión Inferior</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>Bróin ha sido derrotado</rgb>","Para asegurar la Torre, primero se debe conquistar la Sala de Entrada.","Reclamar la Armería","Reclamar la Sala de Reunión Inferior","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Entrada. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el sur al abrirse la puerta hacia la Sala de Audiencias</rgb>","Reclamar la Sala de Audiencias","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Sala de Reunión Superior. Los engranajes rechinan hacia el oeste al abrirse la puerta hacia la Armería</rgb>","La batalla en la torre","El Enemigo está atrincherado en la Torre de Dol Guldur. Es el momento de golpearles en el corazón.","'Mazog ha caído y Zigilburk ha vuelto; es un buen día para ser enano. ¡Regresemos a celebrarlo con un poco de cerveza!'","Reclamar la Sala de Entrada","Con las Salas de Reunión conquistadas, es el momento de tomar la Armería y recuperar Zigilburk.","La Sala de Reunión Superior está justo encima de la Inferior... al conquistarla, el Enemigo quedará confundido y cualquier refuerzo, mal armado.","Bróin debe sobrevivir a la batalla","<rgb=#00FF00>Has conquistado la Armería y recuperado Zigilburk</rgb>"},
[11748]={"Aid Náin the Slakeless with 'A Master of Two Minds'","Mézto stands over several defeated Orcs, his axe slick with black blood","'You have done well, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'The others informed me of the aid you brought them... and not a moment too soon, it seems. Gorgar's forces have been hindered greatly by your hand, but the battle is not yet ended.\
\
'After conferring with Dréri, Mézto, and Órug, our path is clear. The time has come to press the attack!\
\
'I shall send as many of my forces as I can spare into the field to occupy Gorgar's forces, but it is you who shall lead the attack on Bagûd-mekhem!'","Náin the Slakeless, Dréri, Mézto, and Órug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has ordered you to press the attack on the garrison at Bagûd-mekhem. You should speak to Náin the Slakeless, Dréri, Mézto, and Órug and aid them.","The Battle of Azgh-buzru","'It does the Gabil'akkâ no good to call it by any other name... the battle of Azgh-buzru is upon us!\
\
'When we marched to the war-fell, my company numbered in the hundreds, but our losses have been great. What I intended to be a sudden, brutal attack against the Orcs of Gundabad was repelled by their machines of war, and our advance has stagnated into a bloody stalemate. Ground is gained and lost in the span of hours, so much so that I must bare my shame and admit Gorgar has claimed the advantage... at least for the moment. Indeed, he owes much to his defences both within and without Mount Gundabad, but they cannot hold forever!\
\
'I need you to find three of my warriors in the field: Dréri, Mézto, and Órug. I believe you know them. I tasked them with discovering weaknesses in Gorgar's defences, and I would have you exploit those weaknesses.\
\
'Into battle, ${PLAYER}! For the glory of the Gabil'akkâ!'","Find and aid Dréri with 'Death's Breath'","Dréri has taken a defensive position with several wounded Longbeards and Stout-axes","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have aided Dréri, Mézto, and Órug at Azgh-buzru. You should report to Náin and inform him of your success.","Órug peers into the distance where the shapes of several trebuchets punctuate the horizon","'The Battle of Azgh-buzru is won!\
\
'From what I have heard, Bagûd-mekhem has already fallen into disarray. Without Narg-and-Mauz to lead them, it is unlikely they shall ever reforge even the most tenuous alliance. Now those Orcs will prove no match for us proud dwarves... and I suppose not for a ${RACE}.\
\
'The Gabil'akkâ shall see that Bagûd-mekhem is rid of Orcs once and for all, but none of this would have been possible without you, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Let Gorgar lick his wounds while he can for his own defeat is soon to come!'","Find and aid Mézto with 'Vengeance in Kind'","Dréri, Mézto, and Órug can be found among the forces of the Gabil'akkâ at Azgh-buzru.\
\
Náin the Slakeless has commanded you to rally with his forces at Azgh-buzru, the war-fell and aid them in overcoming the forces of Mount Gundabad.","Aid Dréri with 'No Quarter for the Captured'","Náin the Slakeless can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks.\
\
You have aided Náin the Slakeless and the dwarves of the Gabil'akkâ in overcoming the garrison at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report to Náin with news of your victory at Bagûd-mekhem.","Find and aid Órug with 'Engines of Destruction'","Aid Mézto with 'To Stoke A Cold Fire'","Talk to Náin the Slakeless at Drenghól","It is at the Battle of Azgh-buzru that the coming days of the War of Three Peaks are to be decided. The Gabil'akkâ must rout the forces of Gorgar the Ruthless and the Frost-horde or all hopes of mounting an attack on the gates of Mount Gundabad are lost.","Aid Órug with 'The Lieutenants of Gorgar'"},
[11750]={"Habla con Belvagor y comienza la defensa de Lothlórien","'¿Has reunido a tus aliados, ${PLAYER}? Necesitaremos su ayuda, además de la tuya, si queremos rechazar el ataque de los orcos que está a punto de llegar.'","La Batalla de Lórien","Belvagor se encuentra en Caras Galadhon, esperando a que reúnas aliados y hables con él para comenzar la defensa de Lothlórien.","Habla con Belvagor en Caras Galadhon","'Lothlórien está a salvo por ahora, pero los orcos podrían atacar de nuevo. Tú y tus aliados tenéis mi más sincero agradecimiento.\
\
Si los orcos lanzan otro asalto, estaremos preparados, y te pido que vuelvas a estar a nuestro lado si llega el momento.'","Belvagor te espera en Caras Galadhon para hablar contigo sobre la defensa de Lothlórien frente a los orcos.","Belvagor cree que el ataque de los orcos contra Lórien es inminente y espera que tus preparativos —y la fuerza de tu voluntad— sean suficientes para impedir la victoria del enemigo.","'Ha llegado el momento, ${PLAYER}. Debemos confiar en que nuestros preparativos sean suficientes, pues temo que el ataque de los orcos se produzca en cualquier momento. Debemos hablar de nuestro plan para rechazarlos.\
\
Hay tres pasos hacia Fanuidhol: el Paso Occidental, el Paso Septentrional y el Paso Oriental. Tendremos defensores en cada uno de estos pasos, pues si alguno cae, Lothlórien estará en peligro. Pero no basta con resistir a los orcos; debemos rechazar su asalto y eliminar su presencia en Fanuidhol. Los exploradores me dicen que tienen cuatro campamentos entre las colinas y que han erigido un ídolo al Enemigo en cada uno. Llevando un estandarte de Lórien a cada campamento, tus aliados podrán destruir el ídolo. No tendrás mucho tiempo para destruir los cuatro ídolos, ${PLAYER}, y deberás moverte con rapidez. ¡Pero cuidado! El portador del estandarte será un objetivo fácil para los orcos.\
\
Háblame cuando estés listo y hayas reunido aliados, y viajaremos a los pasos de Fanuidhol.'"},
[11751]={"Complete quests in Ost Celebrant (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'You set siege Ost Celebrant by yourself? If it were anyone else, I would think him mad, but I believe your tale.\
\
'The threat that Easterling posed was great, and it is with shame that I admit my blindness to his presence. The danger of more organized brigands serving under the Eye, no less, was of great concern. Nevertheless, your work here with my men and me is finished. Your contribution to our plight has been immense, and it was an honour to serve with you.\
\
'To the east, more of my fellows are making forays into the Rushgore. If you would aid us more, I have more yet to say to you.'","Complete 'An Omen from the East'","The Battle of Ost Celebrant","'Return to your captain, Idmar.'","Talk to Doron","'The battle is won. You fought with such valour, and I am proud to have served at your side.\
\
'I sense my oath remains unfulfilled as I still linger at your side. I fear that some other threat remains beyond our sight.\
\
'You have done well, and I have yet more to speak, but now is not the time. I will return to my post among my men. When you can, come speak with me.'","Doron, leader of the Oathbreakers in Parth Celebrant, has directed you to assault Ost Celebrant. Along with his aid, he hopes that you will rid these once-great ruins of the taint that has befallen them.","'It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}. With my ancient enemy again defeated, I feel at ease. My curse may not be lifted, but I know that along with you, I was able to stand against my foe without the fear that consumed me so long ago.\
\
'The Horse-lords have a strong ally in you. Take the knowledge you have gleaned from our battle in the ruins and bring it to them. I sense the rumblings of a larger conflict in the near future.\
\
'As for me, I will remain with my men. They lie in disarray, and it is my hope that I can one day rally them at my side again.\
\
'Glory to Gondor! Farewell....'","Doron is among his men at the Field of Celebrant, atop a hill in western Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should speak with Doron once more.","Talk to Idmar","'The time has come, ${PLAYER}. We can wait no longer, as every minute we delay brings you and your allies closer to your doom.\
\
'Make haste, travel to Ost Celebrant. Once there, call me forth with a horn of your allies' make, and I will fight by your side.\
\
'There is no time to waste. We must strike!'","Summon Doron","Talk to Doron at the Field of Celebrant","Travel to Ost Celebrant","You have arrived in Ost Celebrant and now must summon Doron to your side","Idmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant.\
\
You should bring news of your victory to Idmar.","'Go to Ost Celebrant. When you arrive, blow your horn to summon me, and I will come.'","'We have work to do at Ost Celebrant.'","Ost Celebrant is the large fortress in south-east Parth Celebrant.\
\
Doron wishes to meet you on the bridge at Ost Celebrant.","You should speak with Doron regarding your assault on Ost Celebrant.","Ost Celebrant is the large fortress in south-east Parth Celebrant.\
\
Doron hopes to aid you by directing your assault as you move towards the heart of the ruins."},
[11752]={"Habla con Tordoron","La batalla de Rhunendin","Tordoron está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Tordoron te ha pedido que le ayudes a montar un asalto contra las fuerzas de Angmar que se reúnen en Rhunendin.","Tordoron está cerca de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Deberías hablar con Tordoron sobre tu victoria contra los Angmarim en Rhunendin.","Mordirith sigue decidido a arrasar Aughaire y reúne sus fuerzas en Rhunendin para lanzar una ofensiva masiva contra los Trév Gállorg.","Viaja con Tordoron a Rhunendin","'¿Has reunido a tus aliados? ¿Estás listo para partir?'","'¡El fin está cerca... lo siento! El dominio de Angmar sobre los montañeses está fallando, y Mordirith se prepara para traer el resto de su fuerza contra los Trév Gállorg.\
\
'¡Debemos atacar al ejército de Angmar en Rhunendin antes de que puedan cruzar Rammas Deluon y avanzar sobre Aughaire! ¿Prestarás tu ayuda? Si es así, reúne a tus aliados y habla conmigo nuevamente cuando podamos partir.'","'Ha llegado el momento, ${PLAYER}... ¡Angmar está fallando! Sin embargo, aún no han perdido, y debemos mantenernos vigilantes contra ellos...'"},
[11753]={"'The beacons have long served to alert the peoples of Gondor and Rohan to the presence of an enemy and to call for aid. The beacon here at Eaworth has been burning for several weeks now.\
\
'In one of the recent assaults, the beacon tower was struck by a catapult. I fear it may have been damaged and is no longer structurally sound. If the beacon were to collapse, the people of the Westemnet would be left unaware of the assaults happening upon our lands.\
\
'Climb the outside of the beacon, from the base to the peak and examine the timbers to ensure they are safe and secure.'","The Beacon of Eaworth is just north of the Mead Hall along the river.\
\
The timbers of the Beacon of Eaworth must be examined to ensure they are undamaged and secure.","<rgb=#FF0000>Completing Aiding the Eastemnet will cancel this quest</rgb>","'The timbers of the beacon are solid and safe? That pleases me.\
\
'We are under heavy assault almost daily, and I expect we will need to check it again soon.'","Cendal is at Eaworth.\
\
Report back to Cendal and inform him that the beacon appears to be structurally sound.","Climb to the top of the Beacon of Eaworth","You have reached the top of the beacon. The timbers all the way up appear secure, solid and undamaged","Talk to Cendal","The Beacon of Eaworth","The Beacon of Eaworth is lit when the Eastemnet is under assault."},
[11754]={"'Ah! A choice set of cuts, ${PLAYER}. The upcoming feast shall be fine indeed!\
\
'I only hope it bolsters the strength of our guests, for it seems that they will have a long and perilous journey ahead of them.'","The Elves of Lothlórien subsist mostly upon the flowering bounty of Lothlórien, but there are those among them that enjoy the chase of the hunt and a finely cooked roast upon special occasions as well.","Bears can be found in the dens of Brochos, which is a ways to the west of the Vineyards of Lórien.\
\
Farasdúr has asked you to hunt the bears of Brochos and return with rich meat.","'The bears of Brochos produce a very hearty meat.'","'Have you had poor fortune in the hunt? I suppose the bears can wait, but the upcoming banquet cannot! Please go to Brochos as soon as you are able.'","Collected bear-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Bears of Brochos","Collect bear-meat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Farasdúr near the Vineyards of Lórien","'We have had much reason to gather and share meals of late, both for honouring the visitors who seek respite in our land, and for the tragic news that reached us in the wake of their arrival.\
\
'For the most part, our people are more than content to subsist upon the bounty of our breads and the greenery cultivated by our gardeners, but we also enjoy the hunt and a fine roast now and again. After all, it does not hurt to bolster the morale of our folk with a little indulgence in such dark times, when battle seems always close at hand.\
\
'To this end, I would have you hunt a few of the wild bears to the west, in the rocky dens of Brochos. Their meat is rich and well worth savouring when properly prepared.'","Farasdúr is near the Vineyards of Lórien in Egladil, east of Brochos.\
\
You should bring the bear-meat you have collected to Farasdúr."},
[11755]={"'Come one, come all! Gaze upon the terror that is the Razor of Belfalas! A twisted creature from the very depths of the sea! Marvel at its frightening visage, and gasp at its every sudden movement!\
\
'But fear not, for I, Ezôti, have tamed this beast.'","A woman attending the show is trying to get your attention.\
\
Speak to the woman across the way in the Upper Ward.","A strange man puts on a 'show' in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","The crowd disperses as Ezôti finishes his show","Gûshida has asked you to pretend to befriend Ezôti in order to gain information from him.\
\
Speak to Ezôti in the Upper Ward.","'Yes, yes, now that I am finished with my show, I have time to speak with you. Hmm? An assistant? Why yes, I could use an assistant....\
\
'It is to be expected that someone as talented as myself would come to command the respect of others! How can I not have seen it before now? My good friend, it would be an honour and a privilege for you to work alongside me, and I have the very task upon which to set you.'","'Can you believe this nonsense? How foolish must these people be to believe his tales? That is a normal sea turtle he's painted and dressed in sea-weed! The poor creature looks miserable.'\
\
She tears her gaze away from the spectacle and gives you an appraising look.\
\
'I have an associate in Zîrar Tarka, Nekhama by name. She wrote to me of an adventurer who looks very much like you... an adventurer who deals honourably with others. Might you be the very one of whom Nekhama spoke?\
\
'Can I rely upon your help to deal with this charlatan? That turtle is not the only creature he has paraded before the crowds he attracts. Before we deal with him, we must rescue his poor captives. Ezôti knows my face and is wary of me, but you might pretend to befriend this man, and then you could learn where he keeps his \\qpets.\\q'","Talk to Ezôti in the Upper Ward","The Beast Tamer Ezôti","Talk to Gûshida across the way from Ezôti"},
[11756]={"¡Tarasâd lanza un rugido de ira!","Derrota a Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas","Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas, derrotado","Los rumores hablan de una gran bestia como ninguna otra. Se encuentra en lo profundo de las Islas Escudo, cazando tanto a corsarios como a filibusteros. Aventúrate y trata de domar a la poderosa bestia.","La bestia de Belfalas","'¡Has derrotado a Tarasâd! ¡Vamos, regresemos a Umbar y demos la buena noticia!'","Encuentra y derrota a Tarasâd, la bestia de Belfalas."},
[11760]={"Return to the fisher Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk with the gathered herbs and crab meat.","Return to Kôrzan in Sen Chatâk","Collected crab claws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Harvested fresh dill (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Harvest fresh dill and collect crab claws from the ponds of Charganpâta.","Collect crab claws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kôrzan has asked you to gather crab meat and herbs for use as fishing bait on the shores of the White-wrath River, near an area infested with zizani.","'Crab makes for the best bait, and if we don't catch anything with this, I think we'll be fine cooking the remaining claws. Thank you, my friend.'","'The fish are no longer biting. I know my skills haven't diminished. It must be the bait!\
\
'Yes that's it. My lures, my technique, all are masterful. But this bait... how can I catch tilapia from the White-wrath with naught but worms? Look at them! They barely wriggle. They should dance across my fingers!\
\
'The best bait... the best bait is crab! Yes, that's what we need! Would you get me some crab meat, outsider? I know with that my prowess would return. And some fresh dill with which we shall cook all these fish. We will be awash in fish, fish up to our waists!'","Harvest fresh dill (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Best Bait"},
[11762]={"La mejor defensa","Assisted Lady Góda with Evidence of Evil","Assist Lady Góda with Sowing Mayhem","After hearing from both Lord Ingmar and Lady Góda, you brought your support of Góda's plan to Reeve Ingbert.","Reeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Ingbert and let him know that Góda's preparations are complete.","'My son is displeased with my decision, but I am Reeve of the Entwash Vale. When his day comes, he may choose his own course.\
\
'While I yearn as well to find glory in battle, my first thoughts must be for my people. If you would, help my mother, Lady Góda, with whatever tasks she has for you. In the meantime, my son and I shall continue siege-preparations here.'","Assisted Lady Góda with Espying the Vale","When you return to Ingbert, it is clear that he is distressed.\
\
'All is not well, ${PLAYER}... the forces of the Orcs are stronger than we had first suspected. I am in a quandary....'","Assist Lady Góda with Blinding the Enemy","Assist Lady Góda with Evidence of Evil","Assisted Lady Góda with Sowing Mayhem","Assist Lady Góda with Espying the Vale","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Lady Góda stands near Reeve Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert has instructed you to lend aid to Lady Góda as she plans the defence of Eaworth.","Assisted Lady Góda with Blinding the Enemy"},
[11763]={"La mejor defensa","Assist Ingmar with Blinding the Enemy","Ingmar stands near Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\
\
Ingbert instructed you to offer your services to his son, Ingmar, while he and Góda continue siege-preparations in Eaworth.","Assist Ingmar with Evidence of Evil","After hearing from both Lord Ingmar and Lady Góda, you brought your support of Ingmar's plan to Reeve Ingbert.","Assist Ingmar with Espying the Vale","Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to Ingbert and let him know that preparations for the attack on the Orcs are complete.","Assisted Ingmar with Espying the Vale","'I have given my son charge of preparing for the assault on the Orcs, though I still will not give him leave to lead the assault himself. If you still desire to aid us, speak with Ingmar and do whatever he bids you.\
\
'Perhaps, if you so desire, you may lead the assault against Maustazg....\
\
'My mother and I will continue to oversee siege-preparations here at Eaworth.'","Assisted Ingmar with Evidence of Evil","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! The time is nearly upon us... are you prepared?'","Assisted Ingmar with Blinding the Enemy","Talk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth","Assist Ingmar with Sowing Mayhem","Assisted Ingmar with Sowing Mayhem"},
[11764]={"'¿Dónde está el carbón que te pedí?'","'Este es mi problema. Hay muchos osos en los bosques del norte. Normalmente, no tengo problemas con ellos. Solo tienes que mantenerte fuera de su camino, y ellos se mantendrán fuera del tuyo, por así decirlo. Pero tengo un gran montón de leña que he pasado un tiempo reuniendo, y un oso negro realmente grande ha decidido que es el lugar perfecto para él y los de su especie.\
\
'El gran oso negro es muy peligroso y ya no puedo acercarme a mi pila de leña. Si me ayudas a deshacerme de él para que pueda tener mi leña, estaré encantado de preparar un paquete de carbón vegetal para tu amigo Hyacinth.\
\
'Mi pila de leña está casi al norte de aquí, pasando la pared y un pequeño campamento maderero. Probablemente encontrarás a ese oso negro justo encima de ella.'","'¡Por favor, deshazte de ese gran oso negro! Está justo al lado de mi pila de leña, directamente al norte de aquí, supongo.'","'Deberías llevar ese carbón a Hyacinth, ahora que lo tienes. Vive en Alforzaburgo, al este de los Grandes Smials, si no recuerdo mal.'","Lleva carbón a Hyacinth Tuk","'Ah, esto estará bien. Espero que el viejo Hart no te haya dado problemas.\
\
'Bueno, ahora deberíamos pasar a nuestro siguiente asunto...'","El montón de leña de Hart Holeman se encuentra al norte, más allá del muro y un pequeño campamento maderero.\
\
Hart Holeman está dispuesto a proporcionarte el carbón que Hyacinth Tuk ha solicitado, pero primero quiere que ahuyentes a un gran oso negro que ha hecho de su montón de leña su hogar.","Hart Holeman está en su casa en el centro de Sobrecolina.\
\
Hart Holeman te había pedido que te ocuparas del gran oso negro que se había instalado en su pila de leña, mientras él preparaba un paquete de carbón para Hyacinth Tuk. Le alegrará saber que el oso ya no le causará más problemas.","El gran oso negro","'¿Lo mataste? Por lo general, no estoy de acuerdo con cazar a los osos locales solo para deshacernos de ellos, pero ese gran oso negro era peligroso, ¡te lo aseguro!\
\
'Toma, lleva este paquete de carbón al joven Hyacinth, con mis mejores deseos y respeto.'","Hyacinth Tuk está en Alforzaburgo, cerca de los Grandes Smials.\
\
Mientras estabas fuera, lidiando con el gran oso negro en el montón de leña de Hart Holeman, Hart estuvo ocupado preparando un paquete de carbón para que se lo llevaras a Hyacinth Tuk.","Un gran oso negro ha decidido usar el montón de leña de Hart Holeman como su hogar, lo que no deja de causarle problemas a Hart."},
[11765]={"Find Tantafod's clutch and defeat Tantafod","Defeated Tantafod","'Harcennun is no less terrible than her sister....'","Tantafod's clutch can be found on the western border of Thrór's Coomb, almost due south of Nár's Peak.\
\
Frithgeir has asked you to seek out Tantafod's clutch and destroy it. Tantafod herself may need to be dispatched as well.","Defeated Harcennun","'I have seen Tantafod, and she is terrible....'","Find Harcennun's clutch and defeat Harcennun","Harcennun's clutch can be found west of Tantafod's clutch, near a large rock outcropping.\
\
Frithgeir asked you to seek out Harcennun's clutch and destroy it. You may have to dispatch Harcennun herself as well.","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund within Nár's Peak, north of the gwibers' clutches.\
\
You should return to Frithgeir and tell him of your heroic deeds.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","'Tantafod and Harcennun have long been the scourge of Thrór's Coomb. The defeat of these creatures marks a step forwards for our safety and the restoration of our home.'","'There are two larger female gwiber that have made their home among the hills below. These dreaded beasts are two of the more powerful gwiber and a great threat to not only us, but the Men who dwell to the west. They are wily and will lurk in hiding, only to emerge when their eggs are disturbed.\
\
'I would have you seek out the clutches of Tantafod and Harcennun and destroy them, lest the gwiber continue to replenish.\
\
'These two clutches can be found in the far western reaches of Thrór's Coomb. Tantafod's clutch can be found on the western border, while Harcennun's clutch might be found near a large standing stone to the west of Tantafod's.'","Among the broken rocks of Thrór's Coomb, the feared gwiber Tantafod and Harcennun make their nests. These matrons are fiercely protective of their nests.","The Bigger Ones"},
[11768]={"Eat food at the second station (3/5)","The Biggest Stomach of Them All (Part II)","'Quickly now! You're not done yet! You must move on to the third station.'","Se te ha acabado el tiempo","You have reached the second station","Eat food at the second station (0/5)","Freddie Symonds is near the second eating station.\
\
You should speak with Freddie Symonds before moving on to the next phase of the eating contest.","Eat food at the second station (4/5)","Everyone loves an eating contest! This challenge is to stuff yourself as fast as you can.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Eat food at the second station (1/5)","A lovely array of different foods can be found at each eating station.\
\
You should eat five foods at the second station -- any foods you like.","The Eating Contest is underway.","Ate food at the second station (4/5)","Ate food at the second station (2/5)","Ate food at the second station (1/5)","Run to the second station","Eat food at the second station (2/5)","Habla con Freddie Simonds","Ate food at the second station (3/5)","Ate food at the second station (5/5)","The second station is down the stairs from the first.\
\
You should run to the second station and begin eating."},
