'¿Te sientes con ánimos para este desafío? ¡Solo los jinetes más valientes deberían intentar semejante hazaña! Sin duda es peligroso, pero tienes un aire resistente.'","The Yule Run is a time-honoured tradition in the Horsefields of Bree. Many challenges have been laid down to present a tricky course for the brave riders of Middle-earth who wish to demonstrate their mettle on horseback.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","Corre hacia la quinta puerta","'It is rare to see such excellent riding in these parts, ${PLAYER}! I am very impressed. You have earned these as a reward for your agile equitation. I hope to see you back soon!'","Corre por la tercera puerta alta sobre el salto precario","Has perdido la carrera","Corre por la sexta puerta baja a través del barro pegajoso","Corre por la sexta puerta alta sobre el salto precario","Monta un caballo de carrera","Las puertas se encuentran siguiendo la pista de carreras en los Campos de Festival de Bree.\
